   "QUESTION_DESC": "<p><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"><b>Explain the role of system programs in an operating system. Discuss their main types and analyze how they support both users and system operations.</b></span></span></p>\n",
